P&M Solutions — Alembic migration scripts.

Run against Neon PostgreSQL:
    PM_DATABASE_URL=postgresql+asyncpg://... .venv/bin/alembic upgrade head

Generate a new revision after model changes:
    PM_DATABASE_URL=... .venv/bin/alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description"

Rollback one revision:
    PM_DATABASE_URL=... .venv/bin/alembic downgrade -1
